abstract: >-
  Repository revision for the PeerJ Computer Science AI Application
  resubmission. Numerical inputs and results are unchanged from peerj-20261002,
  commit e46537227018997c431cbce76775359f3c943a19. Revised documentation and
  author-supplied SQL describe transaction-data access; the original Dune
  transaction CSV is not redistributed. The code reproduces the predictor
  comparison from supplied derived inputs. Author-written code is MIT-licensed;
  author-owned derived data and documentation are CC BY 4.0. Third-party rights
  are excluded as detailed in LICENSE.txt. Cite the version, source commit,
  and Zenodo DOI 10.5281/zenodo.23278765. The archived source commit is
  18c43df6fa302ca5483e118284617c1dd3226867. This main-branch citation metadata
  adds the DOI after archival; the release tag and archived files remain fixed.
